# nasa-neo app API
# Environments: local (port 8000), gardener (port-forward via tools/k8s/port-forward.sh, port 8008)

### Root
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Docs
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### NEOs for current week (week 44, 2026)
GET {{baseUrl}}/neo/week/44

### NEOs for current week — hazardous only
GET {{baseUrl}}/neo/week/44?filter=hazardous

### Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats

### Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 422 — week out of range (too low)
GET {{baseUrl}}/neo/week/0

### 422 — week out of range (too high)
GET {{baseUrl}}/neo/week/54

### 422 — invalid filter value
GET {{baseUrl}}/neo/week/44?filter=unknown
